00:13:11,471 --> 00:13:20,875
[SPEAKER_01]: Always found myself in Montreal or down in Florida looking at architecture and combining them all together is kind of where I got to today.

197
00:13:21,255 --> 00:13:26,257
[SPEAKER_01]: I started a little venture historic Medford, a little trolley tour that we got kind of going on right now.

198
00:13:28,078 --> 00:13:38,141
[SPEAKER_01]: including recently the Jenks district, which Jenks, Judkin Square, excuse me, Judkin Square, which just is not even the terminology I'd used a year or two ago.

199
00:13:38,181 --> 00:13:40,242
[SPEAKER_01]: And now I just can't believe how important it is.

200
00:13:40,302 --> 00:13:46,944
[SPEAKER_01]: So Brad, really interested in seeing your place, circling back on that another time.

201
00:13:46,984 --> 00:13:51,245
[SPEAKER_01]: But I think the idea is for me to be on this committee is to try and help create

202
00:13:51,665 --> 00:14:00,929
[SPEAKER_01]: you know, some awareness of some of these places and then to record them and have people notice them and appreciate them.

203
00:14:01,009 --> 00:14:05,131
[SPEAKER_01]: And sometimes if the architecture is there, it may give it that little extra, you know, push.

204
00:14:05,771 --> 00:14:08,873
[SPEAKER_01]: I'm not here to restrict anybody, but want to enhance things.

205
00:14:08,893 --> 00:14:13,815
[SPEAKER_01]: I want to bring things to some of these homes, some of these families, some of these

206
00:14:15,083 --> 00:14:17,906
[SPEAKER_01]: residences, so that's why I'm here to help.

207
00:14:18,206 --> 00:14:22,650
[SPEAKER_01]: And if we can raise a flag and do some good things to help Medford preserve some of the stuff, great.

208
00:14:23,611 --> 00:14:31,518
[SPEAKER_01]: Free homeowners from some of the problems of this, but enhance what they can, I think is where I wanna be able to help.

209
00:14:32,399 --> 00:14:34,321
[SPEAKER_08]: Great, okay, well, welcome to the commission.

210
00:14:35,182 --> 00:14:36,022
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, actually, welcome.

