269
00:20:23,911 --> 00:20:26,632
[SPEAKER_08]: No, no, it was linkage to, you have to give your name and address.

270
00:20:27,252 --> 00:20:42,037
[SPEAKER_01]: And only say that from the perspective of who may be in that net that may not be applicable, and yet because- I went through that data last week, and I tallied up the,

271
00:20:44,150 --> 00:20:53,183
[SPEAKER_08]: the people who are on the street who are for it and for the historic matrix and I tallied up the ones who are on the street but who are against it.

272
00:20:54,742 --> 00:21:05,005
