298
00:23:18,481 --> 00:23:20,962
[SPEAKER_08]: It was previously to extend all the way to Valley Street.

299
00:23:23,323 --> 00:23:30,466
[SPEAKER_08]: Now Fred proposes cutting it down to stopping just short of Water Street.

300
00:23:32,967 --> 00:23:45,672
[SPEAKER_08]: Anyway, I don't want to, we have other business this evening and I don't want to belabor this because I want our consultant to weigh in on the question of how to proceed in difficult situations like this.

301
00:23:47,350 --> 00:23:50,053
[SPEAKER_08]: Um, so, uh, is it okay to move on?

302
00:23:50,073 --> 00:23:51,754
[SPEAKER_08]: Cause we have a lot to cover tonight.

303
00:23:53,336 --> 00:23:53,556
[SPEAKER_08]: Yes.

304
00:23:54,357 --> 00:23:54,617
[SPEAKER_08]: Okay.

305
00:23:55,738 --> 00:23:58,261
[SPEAKER_08]: Um, let's see.

