00:24:10,052 --> 00:24:12,173
[SPEAKER_00]: that you sent the night before or whatever.

308
00:24:12,193 --> 00:24:26,480
[SPEAKER_00]: So what I'd like to do is process that information to see what it tells us, if anything, about this proposed map and whether we should move it up or move it down or gerrymander it or whatever we think we do.

309
