310
00:24:33,243 --> 00:24:39,306
[SPEAKER_00]: The real intent of trying to get something we think we can get both approved by the city council

311
00:24:40,717 --> 00:24:43,438
[SPEAKER_00]: hopefully the residents of the district as well.

312
00:24:43,498 --> 00:24:44,638
[SPEAKER_00]: So that's the goal.

