742
01:03:54,682 --> 01:04:21,563
[SPEAKER_10]: and if i i think they put a third six-month delay on it and that that just just before the end of that i think is when he took matters in his own hands and tore it down okay well uh... i mean obviously that's not the situation we're dealing with no no no i understand i understand but but but you know uh... it into a fed you know this area is is old there's a lot of old houses here and we wanna and i'll make sure that they last for many more years to come so that's why we're not going to put

