[SPEAKER_08]: They have approximately the same number of people as we do.

852
01:12:18,814 --> 01:12:25,300
[SPEAKER_08]: And they have an executive secretary at city hall for the historical commissions.

853
01:12:26,602 --> 01:12:50,230
[SPEAKER_08]: So I think it would be, but I want Chris to investigate this on a more, Chris Skelly to investigate this on a more global scale and to make a recommendation as whether Medford should provide us with an executive secretary, because I think that would improve, for example, our website, for instance.

854
01:12:51,654 --> 01:13:04,258
[SPEAKER_08]: But more generally, I'd like him to propose a strategy for going forward in creating new historic districts.

855
01:13:06,098 --> 01:13:12,560
[SPEAKER_08]: Compared to the number of houses in Medford, we have just an incredibly small number of historic districts.

856
01:13:12,860 --> 01:13:15,821
