874
01:14:51,615 --> 01:15:02,365
[SPEAKER_01]: So maybe we'll wait for that round of it, and I'd be more than happy to help be on a committee to try and spread the message about what a historic district is and how it helps our city.

875
01:15:02,425 --> 01:15:03,846
[SPEAKER_01]: So I second that.

876
